flowchart LR
  accTitle: NutsNews observability layers
  accDescr {
    NutsNews has live Grafana host and log visibility plus five synthetics from a pre-freeze
    apply. PR 473 telemetry and email hardening, four native SLOs, controlled drills, and
    post-incident verification remain frozen. Sentry remains the exception store.
  }
  Services["Web, workers, backend and VPS"] --> Grafana["Grafana Cloud\nexisting host metrics and logs"]
  Owners["Backend owns deploy, Alloy and outbox; worker repos own service signals;\ninfra owns Grafana; meta repo coordinates"] --> Services
  Services --> WorkerGate["Every worker ownership state still requires deployed, up,\nfresh scrape, exact identity and readiness series"]
  Incident["Historical Runtime 0.x cutover"] --> Failure["28 publication messages, 84 handler-error retries;\nno publication; freshness over 15m"]
  Failure --> Prepare["Observation never started;\nrollback prepare completed"]
  Prepare --> Finalize["Legacy scheduling verified true;\nrollback finalize succeeded"]
  Finalize --> Stable["Stable shadow generation 5; legacy owner, dispatch and scheduling true;\nuplift writes false; single-writer and DNS pass"]
  Stable --> Freeze["Post-rollback hold; failed candidate quarantined;\nno cutover or rollback rerun and no unrelated mutations"]
  Freeze --> Reconcile["Reconcile stable shadow and incident evidence\nbefore observability rollout"]
  Reconcile --> Services
  Baseline["Pre-freeze apply 30708192621"] --> Live["Five live synthetics: two probes, 300s;\n86.4k standing major acknowledged"]
  Live --> Grafana
  Staged["PR 473 and producer source changes"] --> Pending["Staged application telemetry, email,\nfour native SLOs and drills"]
  Readonly["Read-only audit Environment exists;\nall four inputs still absent"] --> Pending
  Pending --> Apply["Future protected apply and post-incident evidence\nafter freeze"]
  Apply --> Grafana
  Apply --> Ownership["Ownership dashboard shows backend revision\nand all eight worker identities"]
  Grafana --> Drilldown["Pipeline-run dashboard uses parsed metadata\nand bounded table field links"]
  Drilldown --> Deferred["Hosted-Loki derived fields and Tempo\nremain deferred"]
  Services --> Sentry["Sentry\nscrubbed exceptions and replays"]
  Workflows["Scheduled health and release workflows"] --> Reports["Durable reports and\ndeployment annotations"]
  Providers["Cloudflare, Vercel, Supabase\nand public uptime monitors"] --> Operator["Operator investigation"]
  Grafana --> Operator
  WorkerGate --> Operator
  Ownership --> Operator
  Drilldown --> Operator
  Sentry --> Operator
  Reports --> Operator
